 "summary": "Native Memory Leak in Sevenz-DeflateDecoder"
 "description": "The class ...sevenz.Coders.DeflateDecoder does not close (end()) the Deflater and Inflater. This can lead to native memory issues: see <https://bugs.openjdk.java.net/browse/JDK-8074108>. In our case we create a zip archive with >100000 files."
